     L"github.com/CostelaCNX/CNX-Updater).\n"
     L"\n"
     L"CNX Updater is a fork of AIO-Switch-Updater by HamletDuFromage (GPL-3.0), built on Borealis "
     L"by natinusala. Their feature set inspired the downloads and cheats in NXbox.\n"
     L"\n"
     L"The full notices are in NOTICE.md in the repository."},
